    "methodCode": "def ks_cdf(d,n):\n if d<=0:return 0.\n if d>=1:return 1.\n tail=(1-d)**n\n for j in range(1,math.floor(n*(1-d))+1):tail+=d*math.comb(n,j)*(d+j/n)**(j-1)*max(0,1-d-j/n)**(n-j)\n return max(0.,min(1.,1-tail))\ndef inv(func,p,hi):\n lo=0.\n for _ in range(100):\n  mid=(lo+hi)/2\n  if func(mid)<p:lo=mid\n  else:hi=mid\n return (lo+hi)/2\n",
